OL,3,GNEWSANew chief constable for
OL,4,AStaffordshire announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Gardner has been announced as the
OL,7,Fnew chief constable for Staffordshire
OL,8,FPolice.
OL,10,FGardner, currently acting chief
OL,11,Fconstable at Warwickshire Police, was
OL,12,Fnamed by the county's police, fire and
OL,13,Fcrime commissioner Ben Adams as his
OL,14,Fpreferred candidate for the top job.
OL,16,FHe replaces Chris Noble, who was sacked
OL,17,Fin July after he was found to have
OL,18,Fcommitted gross misconduct.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
