OL,3,GNEWSANew chief constable for
OL,4,AStaffordshire announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FNone of the allegations against Noble,
OL,7,Fwhich involved his time at Humberside
OL,8,FPolice as well as in Staffordshire, can
OL,9,Fbe reported because of restrictions set
OL,10,Fby a misconduct panel.
